<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="kitControl-Limiter" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-Limiter</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component limits the range of a numeric input  from inMin to inMax. It calculates the output as follows:  y  = min(InMax, max(InMin, u)), where u is an input
and <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">InMax</parmname> and <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">InMin</parmname> are properties.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Claudia Serwe &lt;claudia.serwe@tridium.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "/></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
    
    <p class="- topic/p ">If <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">InMax</parmname> &lt; <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">InMin</parmname>, an error occurs and no output is generated.</p><p class="- topic/p "><image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/kitControl-Limiter.png" class="- topic/image "/></p><p class="- topic/p ">Properties:<ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">In Min (numeric): lower limit of input</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">In Max (numeric): upper limit of input<image placement="break" href="../graphic/kitControl-Limiter2.png" class="- topic/image "/></p></li></ul></p><p class="- topic/p ">Limiter is available in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Math</uicontrol> folder of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">kitControl</apiname> palette.</p>
    </section></refbody></reference>